Org10
=====

Stage 10 of the organiser made in the book "Writing Desktop
Applications in JavaScript" (Manuals.JSApps), chapter 10.

This stage adds the ring binder: a
coloured tab for each section (Ctrl-1 to Ctrl-6), pages that turn,
and the Address section - !Contacts' address book, used unchanged.
Everything is kept in one Organiser file (F3 saves).

The finished organiser is !Organiser.
